# Botify

## Situation

Retail client experienced a 20% decline in organic search revenue.

## Task

Determine whether the decline was caused by market conditions or a website issue.

## Action

Investigated SEO KPIs.

Aggregate metrics looked healthy.

Segmented by page type.

Found product pages buried deep in the site's internal linking structure.

Recommended updating internal links.

## Result

Revenue recovered within weeks.

Organic search revenue increased approximately 7% YoY.

## Lessons Learned

Aggregate metrics can hide important insights.

Segmentation often reveals the true root cause.